---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Font Identifier"
  description="Privacy policy for Font Identifier: what data we collect (almost none), how images you upload are handled, and third-party services."
  path="/privacy-policy/"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12">
    <nav class="text-sm text-slate-500">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-indigo-600">Home</a> <span class="mx-1">/</span> Privacy Policy
    </nav>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: October 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Font Identifier is designed to collect as little data as possible. This policy explains
        what happens when you use the site.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Images you upload</h2>
      <p>
        The "Identify Font from Image" tool processes your image entirely in your own browser
        using JavaScript: it automatically detects the lettering, analyzes the letter shapes,
        and compares them against a font-shape reference file (about 1.5&nbsp;MB) that your
        browser downloads from our hosting when a scan runs. Your image is never uploaded to
        our servers, never stored, and never shared with anyone. Closing the tab discards it
        completely.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Accounts and personal data</h2>
      <p>
        There are no accounts, no sign-ups, and no contact forms that store your details. We do
        not ask for your name, email address, or any personal information to use the tools.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We do not set any cookies ourselves, and we currently run no analytics on this site.
        If that changes, this policy will be updated.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Third-party services</h2>
      <p>
        Font previews are loaded from Google Fonts (fonts.googleapis.com / fonts.gstatic.com).
        When your browser fetches a font, Google receives standard request data such as your IP
        address, as described in Google's Privacy Policy. We have no control over that request
        beyond choosing to use the service.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy? Reach us via the <a href="/contact/" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
